Directory of "Mail:fido/":

    - docs/

        - Directory contains doc files specific to my area, region, hub, etc.

    - other/

        - Directory contains odd dos utilities I haven't found a use for yet.

    - ClearAcct

        - Allows you to clear the accounting statistics for any/all nodes
          that have called you.

    - ENumNet

        - Similar to EnumNode, except you specify the HUB.

    - GetNode

        - Given a Node Address, this gives you info on the system, as found
          in the NodeList.

    - ListAcct

        - Displays chart listing accounting activity of all Nodes who have
          ever used your system.

    - DoTick.rexx
    - NodeDiff.rexx
    - Poll.rexx

        - These are standard ARexx scripts which are called from various
          utilities. The "Poll.rexx" is called from the DOS scripts, while
          the "DoTick" and "NodeDiff" ones are called from "Poll-Script2".

